[6.010, "o", "\r\n  source : Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie) (Debian, desktop: none (headless))\r\n  target : bluefin [ghcr.io/ublue-os/bluefin:stable] (Fedora, desktop: GNOME, backend: Bootc)\r\n  mode   : Hybrid\r\n\r\n  already in target image            4 package(s)\r\n  layer into system image            1 package(s)\r\n      nginx\r\n  Homebrew                           2 package(s)\r\n      neovim  ripgrep\r\n\r\n  config files: 19 → /etc, 0 → toolbox, 0 → brew, 592 skipped\r\n\r\n"]
